e-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Mother honks her horn.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/5/55/Mother_honks_her_horn..png/revision/latest?cb=20210211202805\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Mother honks her horn.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/5/55/Mother_honks_her_horn..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210211202805\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/5/55/Mother_honks_her_horn..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210211202805 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/5/55/Mother_honks_her_horn..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210211202805 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Mother honks her horn.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Mother_honks_her_horn..png\" data-image-name=\"Mother honks her horn..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_7\" title=\"Series 7\">7</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rhod_Gilbert\" title=\"Rhod Gilbert\">Rhod Gilbert</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_perfect_stuff.\" title=\"The perfect stuff.\">The perfect stuff.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_pendulum_draws_the_eye.\" title=\"The pendulum draws the eye.\">The pendulum draws the eye.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Mother honks her horn.</b></i> is the eighth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_7\" title=\"Series 7\">Series 7</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 24 October 2018. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Rhod_Gilbert\" title=\"Rhod Gilbert\">Rhod Gilbert</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Mother_honks_her_horn.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Mother honks her horn\" was a phrase used by <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> to describe <a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Wang\" title=\"Phil Wang\">Phil Wang</a>'s trumpet playing during the <a href=\"/wiki/Compose_the_best_30_second_piece_of_music\" title=\"Compose the best 30 second piece of music\">Compose the best 30 second piece of music</a> task. The title card shows a tree branch, which is potentially a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Poke_something_out_of_the_hole_in_the_roof_of_this_grotto\" title=\"Poke something out of the hole in the roof of this grotto\">Poke something out of the hole in the roof of this grotto</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Mother_honks_her_horn.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Mor dytter i hornet', which translates as 'Mother honks the horn'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Äiti tööttää torveaan', which translates as 'Mother honks her horn'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Mother_honks_her_horn.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/James_Acaster\" title=\"James Acaster\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">James Acaster</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jessica_Knappett\" title=\"Jessica Knappett\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jessica Knappett</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Kerry_Godliman\" title=\"Kerry Godliman\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Kerry Godliman</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Phil_Wang\" title=\"Phil Wang\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Phil Wang</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Rhod_Gilbert\" title=\"Rhod Gilbert\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Rhod Gilbert</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Creepiest_thing\" title=\"Creepiest thing\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Creepiest thing.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Poke_something_out_of_the_hole_in_the_roof_of_this_grotto\" title=\"Poke something out of the hole in the roof of this grotto\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Poke something out of the hole in the roof of this grotto.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Scream\" title=\"Scream\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Puzzle:</b> C. Now look in the microwave (End task: Scream).\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Compose_the_best_30_second_piece_of_music\" title=\"Compose the best 30 second piece of music\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Compose the best 30 second piece of music.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Bob_when_you_hear_the_surname_of_a_famous_Bob\" title=\"Bob when you hear the surname of a famous Bob\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> <br />Bob when you hear the surname of a famous Bob. <br />Pat when you hear the surname of a famous Pat. <br />Kneel when you hear the surname of a famous Neil. <br />Stew when you hear the surname of a famous Stu. <br />Wane when you hear the surname of a famous Wayne.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td>19\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td>9\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\"><b>20</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Video\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Mother_honks_her_horn.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Video\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><small><i>Video unavailable in some regions. Find an alternative service <a href=\"/wiki/Watch_Taskmaster\" title=\"Watch Taskmaster\">here</a>.</i></small>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"> <a href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/File:Taskmaster_-_Series_7,_Episode_8_-_Full_Episode_-_%27Mother_honks_her_horn.%27\" class=\"video video-thumbnail medium \"> \t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/ae/Taskmaster_-_Series_7%2C_Episode_8_-_Full_Episode_-_%27Mother_honks_her_horn.%27/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20210130003942\" alt=\"Taskmaster_-_Series_7,_Episode_8_-_Full_Episode_-_&#39;Mother_honks_her_horn.&#39;\" height=\"263\" width=\"350\" data-video-key=\"Taskmaster_-_Series_7,_Episode_8_-_Full_Episode_-_&#39;Mother_honks_her_horn.&#39;\" data-video-name=\"Taskmaster - Series 